"Generates 8 unique cryptographic secret keys and salts and writes them into "
"wp-config.php to secure cookies and sessions."
msgstr ""
"Gera 8 chaves secretas criptográficas e salts exclusivos e os grava no wp-"
"config.php para proteger cookies e sessões."

